<title>JAPAN: Nihon Inter - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Nihon Inter - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 13.54		vs	   12.46</p>
<p> Operating	  570    million	  vs	  341    million</p>
<p> Current	    474    million	  vs	  229    million</p>
<p> Net		  191    million	  vs	   82    million</p>
<p> EPS		    7.32 yen	  vs	    3.14 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     26 million	  vs	  26 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  2.50 yen	  vs	    2.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Nihon Inter Electronics Corp is a leading maker of discrete semiconductors.</p>
